	;; Contact terminals -- 13 (COM), 14 (NO). #250 Faston tabs, no PCB drill (see descr).
	;; Standard #250 blade width = 6.35mm (industry standard, not datasheet-specific).
	;; NO COPPER (F.Fab only, no *.Cu/*.Mask/*.Paste) -- the datasheet's own Terminal
	;; Arrangement diagram labels these "Tab Terminal" (zero PCB land on the G4A-1A-E
	;; variant), distinct from "PCB Terminal" (A1/A2, real thru-hole below). Pad
	;; number/type/size/position unchanged from the prior F.Cu version, so netlist and
	;; pin-count parity are unaffected -- only the fictitious copper was removed. See
