	;; Case 1 for the full derivation, KiCad-behavior verification, and open item.
	;; Placed on the long edge opposite the coil row, mirroring the coil's left/right
	;; split per the datasheet's Terminal Arrangement diagram -- Y offset is a
	;; reasonable placement, not a measured value (see CAUTION in descr).
	(pad "13" smd rect
